    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHILIST NOW AND FOLLOW US!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/ef33c5b12f99c0c76b18df1fefeba4e9.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/ef33c5b12f99c0c76b18df1fefeba4e9.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/ef33c5b12f99c0c76b18df1fefeba4e9.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/85c91d0d561a887ee208f7d058a87fe8.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique skills and attributes that can be strategically combined based on the needs of battle. Whether you choose a powerful melee warrior or a spellcasting mage, you\u2019ll find a role that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=792 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/d07acf3719c651bef6823fa4f960fea6.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to form a circle to enhance your attack or line up in a row to increase your speed. With simple switching mechanics, you can quickly respond to the ever-changing battle conditions and fully unleash your team\u2019s potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=792 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/934c889fce7b265c44e53d12263b383a.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playstyles complement each other, allowing for rich combat strategies. Explore various possibilities, discover hidden combinations, and find the best synergies to showcase your heroes\u2019 extraordinary strength and style in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/54fba533ce0edd3708d0b9dbfeedbfb9.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, rhythmic combat where every attack delivers a powerful impact. With fluid movements and stunning skill effects, enjoy an addictive, high-speed battle experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/85c91d0d561a887ee208f7d058a87fe8.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character has unique skills and attributes that can be strategically combined based on the needs of battle. Whether you choose a powerful melee warrior or a spellcasting mage, you\u2019ll find a role that suits you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=792 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/eae6d1970c2523bf2ec218839f527e52.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/d07acf3719c651bef6823fa4f960fea6.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to form a circle to enhance your attack or line up in a row to increase your speed. With simple switching mechanics, you can quickly respond to the ever-changing battle conditions and fully unleash your team\u2019s potential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=792 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/3f17829d1d9af9c2154bb4637fe972de.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/934c889fce7b265c44e53d12263b383a.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different playstyles complement each other, allowing for rich combat strategies. Explore various possibilities, discover hidden combinations, and find the best synergies to showcase your heroes\u2019 extraordinary strength and style in battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/776145ab61053a1da16fe47becad2e60.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/54fba533ce0edd3708d0b9dbfeedbfb9.avif?t=1751250189\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience fast-paced, rhythmic combat where every attack delivers a powerful impact. With fluid movements and stunning skill effects, enjoy an addictive, high-speed battle experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.poster.avif?t=1751250189\" width=790 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.webm?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3251240/extras/930e69e398e03372c6310661bbfad79b.mp4?t=1751250189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
